# Nested node_modules directories the sandbox should overlay with its own
# per-stack volume, one repo-relative directory per line.
#
# Without this, web/node_modules is shared with the macOS host, so whichever
# platform installed last wins and the other one gets
# "Cannot start service: Host version X does not match binary version Y"
# from esbuild, or a missing @rollup/rollup-<platform> module.
#
# Requires relaunching the sandbox to take effect.
web
